## 2026-11-16T22:12:19Z ICT
{"slug":"ICT","companyName":"Integrated Control Technology (ICT)","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/integrated-control-technology","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T22:12:19Z","followerCount":28965,"bio":"Integrated Control Technology (ICT) is a world leading manufacturer of unified electronic access control and security solutions enabling a scalable solution for organizations to protect their people, operations and information.\n\nICT's Protege\u00ae seamlessly integrates a full suite of security management functions and technologies using an open architecture design. offering electronic access control, ID credential issuance and management; alarm monitoring, apartment management, digital video surveillance and management, real-time digital video content analysis, integration of biometric technologies, intrusion detection and smart card functionality, plus integration with a multitude of third-party systems.\n\nBased in Auckland, New Zealand, ICT has a global presence with offices located in Denver (Colorado USA), Amersham (United Kingdom), and Sydney (Australia) to provide full local sales, support and service to our clients and partners around the world.\n\nTo learn more, visit www.ict.co","recentPosts":[{"date":"2026-11-16","text":"Four live demos will be running on Stand E17 at Melbourne Build Expo, and each one is built around a type of building you might be planning or specifying: a local government site, an apartment building, a hospital and a school.\nBehind them, our Government and Commercial panels show where Protege GX fits across a council precinct or a residential tower, and the team can take you through any of it on the system itself, from the operator's dashboard to the readers on the door.\nBring a project or just a question, and we'll show you how it would work in your building.\nLooking forward to it!\n#MelbourneBuild #ICT","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/integrated-control-technology/home/"},{"date":"2026-11-12","text":"We're exhibiting at Melbourne Build, alongside The Security Event Australia, later this month, and we're looking forward to meeting the architects, specifiers, builders and facility teams who plan and run Melbourne's buildings, as well as the integrators who install for them.\nYou'll find Ben Italiano, Matthew Trofa, Richard Kelly and Luke Dixon on Stand E17 at the Melbourne Convention and Exhibition Centre on 25 and 26 November, from 9:30am both days. If you're heading along, come by and say hello!\n#MelbourneBuild #ICT","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/integrated-control-technology/home/"},{"date":"2026-11-12","text":"Day one of the Self Storage Association of Australasia conference on the Gold Coast was a busy one!\nMatthew Trofa and Stephen Thompson from team ICT, and Millennium Technology's Danie Harmse, David Hore and Barry Mitchell have sure been busy on the stand. Multiple conversations happneing at once and plenty of interest.\nOur thanks to everyone who came by to look at gxStorAccess and Protege GX.\nWe\u2019re on the stand until the show closes at 1:45pm today, so if you\u2019re still around, come and say hello.\n#GC26 #ICT","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/integrated-control-technology/home/"},{"date":"2026-11-11","text":"Fantastic to be exhibiting this week at The Security Event Asia!\nOne highlight of the show is our new Logistic demo - showcasing how ICT Protege GX can be implemented in a busy port, including truck and freight management, and post sorting facility.\nIt was also a highlight today to be joined by ICT Partner, Visium Networks. Thanks for joining us Jason Farmer, Lee Ian Leong Kye and team!\nIf you're attending this week, come along and say hello. Ben Italiano and Jacky Chow and manning the stand until 12 November.\n#TSEAsia #ICT","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/integrated-control-technology/home/"},{"date":"2026-11-09","text":"The Self Storage Week trade show opens tomorrow at The Star Gold Coast, and you'll find us on Stand 36 with Millennium Technology.\nMatthew Trofa and Stephen Thompson from ICT and Barry Mitchell, Danie Harmse and David Hore from Millennium will be on the stand from 10:30am Wednesday until it closes on Thursday afternoon.\nIf you're looking at gate access, unit alarms or managing sites from your phone, come and try the ICT Protege GX and gxStorAccess demo.\nWe're looking forward to seeing you there!\n#GC26 #ICT","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/integrated-control-technology/home/"}]}
## 2026-11-16T22:11:38Z BOSCH
{"slug":"BOSCH","companyName":"Bosch Security and Safety Systems","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/bosch-security-systems","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T22:11:38Z","followerCount":48968,"bio":"This LinkedIn page for Bosch Security and Safety Systems is no longer active.\nThe business has been acquired by Triton and is now part of the Keenfinity Group, an independent company delivering professional communication and security solutions that connect and protect people and assets. Keenfinity Group combines leading brands and expertise across Audio, Video Systems, Intrusion & Access, and Electronics Manufacturing Services (EMS), serving customers worldwide.\n\nTo continue receiving product updates, insights, and news, please follow our dedicated LinkedIn pages: \n\u2022 Video Systems: IQSIGHT https://www.linkedin.com/company/iqsight\n\u2022 Intrusion & Access: Radionix https://www.linkedin.com/company/radionix\n\u2022 Conference Solutions | Keenfinity Group https://www.linkedin.com/company/bosch-conference-solutions\n\u2022 Public Address & Voice Alarm | Keenfinity Group https://www.linkedin.com/company/public-address-solutions\n\nMore information: www.keenfinity-group.com","recentPosts":[{"date":"2026-07-19","text":"\u203c\ufe0fImportant update\u203c\ufe0f\nThis LinkedIn page Bosch Security and Safety Systems is no longer active.\nTo continue receiving updates and insights on our products, please follow our dedicated LinkedIn pages that are now part of Keenfinity Group:\n\u00b7\u00a0Video Systems \ud83d\udc49 IQSIGHT\n\u00b7\u00a0Intrusion & Access Systems \ud83d\udc49 Radionix\n\u00b7\u00a0Conference Solutions \ud83d\udc49 Conference solutions | Keenfinity Group\n\u00b7\u00a0Public Address Systems \ud83d\udc49 Public Address & Voice Alarm | Keenfinity Group\nThank you for being part of our community here. We look forward to staying connected with you on LinkedIn.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/bosch-security-systems/home/"},{"date":"2026-07-19","text":"Trusted worldwide. Built for what matters.\nThe transition from Bosch Video Systems to IQSIGHT is officially complete.\nWhile our name has changed, the foundation remains the same: more than 60 years of engineering excellence, trusted products, global expertise, and a commitment to helping organizations operate safely, securely, and without interruption.\nFrom everyday operations to mission-critical environments, we deliver reliable, intelligence-first video solutions that perform.\nWelcome to the next chapter. Stay connected with us here > https://lnkd.in/gjd8fz9U","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/bosch-security-systems/home/"},{"date":"2026-07-19","text":"Final reminder: Public Address and Voice Alarm content continues on our dedicated page.\nThis will be our final PAVA-related post on this channel!\nFrom now on, Public Address and Voice Alarm content will continue on the dedicated Public Address & Voice Alarm LinkedIn page.\nThe page is active, focused and built for technical consultants, system integrators, specifiers, project engineers and other professionals working with PAVA systems.\nThank you for following the PAVA conversation here. We look forward to continuing it with you on the dedicated page. See you there?\n\ud83d\udc49 https://lnkd.in/dDcDKfU7\n#BoschPublicAddress #PRAESENSA #PublicAddressandVoiceAlarm #VoiceAlarm #Countdown","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/bosch-security-systems/home/"},{"date":"2026-07-19","text":"We're moving all Conference Systems updates to our \ud835\uddf1\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddf1\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddf0\ud835\uddee\ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddf1 #Conference Solutions \ud835\udddf\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf8\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddf1\ud835\udddc\ud835\uddfb \ud835\uddfd\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf4\ud835\uddf2.\nBy following our conference solutions page, you'll receive updates on audio innovation, meeting management, industry trends, events, and product developments, all in one place.\nNo unrelated content. Just